      <li>Lower cost of living compared to other major cities, reducing financial pressure for dual-income families</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Planning Your Next Steps</h2>
    <p>Whether you're a military spouse entering San Antonio's job market or looking to advance your existing career, timing and strategy matter. The families who succeed often:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Start career research 2-3 months before PCS</li>
      <li>Leverage military spouse-specific job resources</li>
      <li>Network actively in your professional field</li>
